Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:19.42,Staff,,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,500)}本字幕由动漫国字幕组制作(dmguo.org)\N仅供试看,请支持购买正版音像制品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:24.26,Staff,,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,500)}翻译&时轴:傻瓜三世   后期:小圣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:34.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}目を合わせたら　相変わらずの顔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:39.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}セーブデータは今も　あの日のまま
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}『もう戻れない』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:51.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}立ち止まってる　君の背中に　何も言えなかったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}そんなんじゃないって
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:22:00.75,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}君にただ笑ってほしくて悶えてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:06.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}もう止まらない　この感情が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:12.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しい　寂しい　全てを叫ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:18.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}どんな想いだって　伝えてもまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:22.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}溢れてるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}未来を測れ　たった2秒だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:34.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}わずかでいい　掴み取る今
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:44.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大丈夫　何が起きても　一緒だから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}恐れない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:34.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}和你对上了眼 你还是当初的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:39.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}到了现在 存档还停留在那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}「已经回不去了」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:51.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}看着你驻足的背影 我什么都说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不是你想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:22:00.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我只想看到你的欢笑 所以才如此难过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:06.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}可是心头的感情已经难以抑制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:12.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}有欣喜 有寂寞 心声呐喊着一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:18.56,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}无论怎样的思念 哪怕向你传达
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:22.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}却如何都倾诉不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:28.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}预想下未来 2秒后的样子就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:34.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}哪怕是片刻良机 我也会抓在手心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:44.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你放心 无论发生任何事 有你的陪伴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我便无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:44.93,Title,,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(462,966)\pos(1094,686.667)}约定 -Protocol-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我好紧张啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是领队  冷静下来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,成年人要稳重点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们说得简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,赢下这一场就是职业选手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,输了就全盘皆输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对手还是Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓  我们赢过他们一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这次无论如何都要赢下他们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是为了美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧  瞬?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要赢下来  让美樱能够走路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说的没错  必须赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,来了  请问是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的经纪人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  悠宇一直是我们这儿的好队员…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说多少次你才懂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你不许参赛了!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今天要决定结果了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,身份暴露的话怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最重要的比赛!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,请站住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不让
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,悠宇很不愿意离开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边是工作上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边也是工作上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少拿玩游戏来说事!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对一步不让!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是最后一次!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我就最后尝试一次  求求您了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,求求您了!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘记你刚刚说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都这时候了  我还…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,之前你付出了很大努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能走到这里也托了你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  要是输了我们都是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,至少经纪人允许你参加这场比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  先专注于比赛上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,赢下这场比赛  一定要打进职业联赛!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是输了  我就离开这个家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不会回来见你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我赢了  你就要乖乖住院!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而且要全心全意地复健!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下一场比赛由TEAM FOXONE对阵Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,关系到TEAM FOXONE能否进联赛的最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,赢下就进联赛  输了就会被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们不容有失的一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,双方之前两场交手都是Sleeping OWL获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE能在这一场报仇吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,开局攻方为Sleeping OWL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,守方为TEAM FOXONE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A点多名敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我来骚扰喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,堕猫  你别急啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉Spreader了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,发现Longshot和Heavybarrel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影在与之交战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠得很近  包夹他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉了!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,小路有人打掉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一杀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我被干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,FOXONE还剩一人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉JONATHAN了  还有一人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,反败为胜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,又是拿其他人当诱饵的策略?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会…之前两场他们都是正常打的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,JONATHAN啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,下一场能把指挥交给我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.21,0:04:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又想拿我们当诱饵吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是你的绿叶!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是上次我们赢了  完胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是赢了就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以无关紧要的比赛也要打得有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  教练?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,冠军赛ROX的单人秀得到了运营和赞助商的好评
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是有意做就能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们队可以做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们都是一流的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要把比赛变成表演不是很简单吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们又用同一套策略
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办啊  星诗流?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  我们准备了对策
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人换用B计划喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,避免单人行动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,以两人小队和三人小队进行防守
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,既然想玩螳螂捕蝉  黄雀在后的套路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再来只猫  专门抓你这只黄雀不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在说什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好!  援护成功!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  我都干掉黄雀了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,原来还有豹子盯着猫的吗!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我真听不懂你在说什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,被绕背了喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们聚在一起行动被抓到漏洞了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从一开始就知道我们的防守弱点吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,反败为胜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,反败为胜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,中场休息  现在是战术讨论时间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping OWL五局全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FOXONE一定很想扭转颓势
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ROX  我们能继续这样拿下完胜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我也同情她  但希望她能就此死心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  为什么都被对面算到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  根本反击不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事  每次队员被打倒的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,都有人在可以击杀我们的位置吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能动得那么快!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就说明他们预判到了我们所有动作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过的  我能看到未来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的战胜不了睦生吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要我走路的话  就赢给我看!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到的话就少管闲事!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是输了  我就离开你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,继续这样赢不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要是输了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是赢不了的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是我的错…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是我的错…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想保护好她…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想跟哥哥在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟美樱…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,会再也见不到面的!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,赢啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥  赢下来啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看来回天乏术了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,时野谷太太  我们正在重要关头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  出大事了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈的电话!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱  加油啊!  美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走起来了…美樱走路了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧  美樱?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力了…你也不许不努力!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要赢…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你输了  再也见不到面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不接受!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对…绝对不会原谅你!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定赢  赢给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定凯旋回家!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  照顾好美樱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拼了  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,美樱都做到了  我们怎么可以做不到!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不是说泄气话的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这下真的是无路可退了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有决心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么决心?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这场比赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打出我自己的样子!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.65,0:11:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个笨丫头!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪  那个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跟女演员悠好像啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是她吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可是跟电视上完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是她!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,悠姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好吗  悠宇?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我不能一个人明哲保身
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁可舍弃一切也要战斗!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,悠宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思  大家都背水一战是吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,攻守方交换
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE主攻  继续游戏!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什么计划吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  还没制定计划呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哎!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓  我冲锋!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我掩护你!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,突破了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我和小瞬马上靠过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个敌人  我可以!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝黑暗的疾风喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,清除器已安放  还要坚持45秒喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,换守势  迎击阵型!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A点通道多名敌人!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  会被突破!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在  绕到背后!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,棒  指挥得好!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,晓斗  我们夹击他们!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  别叫我真名!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方获胜!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,保住希望了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这下没法给人家剃光头了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看来对手的行动准则变了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我援护你!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,按计划D来喵!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,冲锋!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方获胜!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶!  第2分!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有机会!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经我看不到  但现在我看得到未来!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他藏在那个位置…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,说明这边会有人!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而ROX就会藏在…那边!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  这下有意思了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你被打死了  笑什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到了…现在他能看到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,攻方获胜!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,TEAM FOXONE扭转比分!  他们步调迅猛!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好  干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Longshot来拆弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我拆清除器  你们拦住敌人!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,全灭他们比较快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ROX双杀!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping OWL也还以颜色!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,比分来到了6比6  双方赛点!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下一局是最后一局啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  这一局分胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,下定决心上吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,自由开火!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我rush B!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你们的  只是佯攻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是骗你们的  我这边是主攻!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人  B点对了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,突击!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人过来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太快了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们少得意!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬  X计划!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,冲锋!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟着你!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我被闪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我顶上!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,清点!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很好!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,清除器已安放
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,守住45秒!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,收到!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我将回归黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪  他在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没打中头?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没子弹了?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要死一起死!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们确定独占第6名!  打进联赛了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶  好耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶  我们成功了  瞬!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我累坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  真是艰难漫长的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉这是我最快乐的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.26,0:19:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我也觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的比赛真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你可以做到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,今后我还能和变强的你继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我开心极了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  我已经期待下一次对碰了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,完了  幻影忍者的真身成头条了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:16.90,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs20\bord0\c&H000000&\3c&H5F552D&\pos(431.334,451.334)}戴面具的电竞选手  真身是女演员悠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.66,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}没想到悠是那么粗鲁的性格\N形象崩坏了\N这不是我的悠\N又不是比赛的问题  是她自己找事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,悠的粉丝也吵起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你可给我惹乱子了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坂上小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的事让你失去了不少粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我对相关方谎称  幻影忍者是事务所秘密进行的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道四处解释的我有多辛苦吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说说接下来的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,幻影忍者的经纪工作可以交给我们事务所吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也有不少人表示了好感
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:00.99,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs28\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}不仅可爱还有着坚定的意念  我迷上她了\N看到了悠意外的一面  真好\N反差萌\N我不认识这个人  但对她挺有好感的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们来经营  你可以更有人气的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆TEAM FOXONE的经纪工作也交给我们吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我回来了
